    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're proud to announce the latest update to the game and demo for BHF 2.0!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Localization added for 10+ new languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Enemies Added to Endless Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Wild Magics Added to Endless Mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867140/extras/f03c014c70111797db8b8d9e9917496e.poster.avif?t=1733321255\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867140/extras/f03c014c70111797db8b8d9e9917496e.webm?t=1733321255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Castor, the unlikely to venture across a magical kingdom and defeat the monstrous Moon Menace to rescue the Star Sovereign! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic games like One Finger Death Punch, Galaga, and Missile Command. Players drop into the thick of the action and must fend off waves of increasing difficulty in order to vanquish their foes and restore order to the land! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>70+ Unique Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix of game mechanics constantly changing to keep things interesting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867140/extras/8e036e76be376d50a2ebb327262b6bda.poster.avif?t=1733321255\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867140/extras/8e036e76be376d50a2ebb327262b6bda.webm?t=1733321255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867140/extras/8e036e76be376d50a2ebb327262b6bda.mp4?t=1733321255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Custom Player Builds via the &quot;Wild Magic&quot; System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game your own way with powerful magic spells!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867140/extras/ed4384f3fe14d99124ee7b7180f32774.poster.avif?t=1733321255\" width=600 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867140/extras/ed4384f3fe14d99124ee7b7180f32774.webm?t=1733321255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867140/extras/ed4384f3fe14d99124ee7b7180f32774.mp4?t=1733321255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose-Your-Own-Path Style Map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear gameplay to let players lead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867140/extras/c0eeae1109549968f9d54b31044fdf87.poster.avif?t=1733321255\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867140/extras/c0eeae1109549968f9d54b31044fdf87.webm?t=1733321255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867140/extras/c0eeae1109549968f9d54b31044fdf87.mp4?t=1733321255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlocks and Discoverable Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OOOOOHHHH SHINIES!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867140/extras/98677e8fdd4f2e76d26f8c99f5fb95ef.poster.avif?t=1733321255\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867140/extras/98677e8fdd4f2e76d26f8c99f5fb95ef.webm?t=1733321255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867140/extras/98677e8fdd4f2e76d26f8c99f5fb95ef.mp4?t=1733321255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Comical Story Full of Misfit Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True power fantasy fulfillment!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867140/extras/de9855c44612dc76795ae71260065862.poster.avif?t=1733321255\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867140/extras/de9855c44612dc76795ae71260065862.webm?t=1733321255\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867140/extras/de9855c44612dc76795ae71260065862.mp4?t=1733321255\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
